│ │    <C-y>  Scroll the view up a row                                                                                         │ │
│ │    zz  Centre the cursor row in the view                                                                                   │ │
│ │    zt  Put the cursor row at the top of the view                                                                           │ │
│ │    zb  Put the cursor row at the bottom of the view                                                                        │ │
│ │    H  Go to the top row of the view                                                                                        │ │
│ │    M  Go to the middle row of the view                                                                                     │ │
│ │    L  Go to the bottom row of the view                                                                                     │ │
│ │    <Tab>  Select the next link, then the next pane                                                                         │ │
│ │    <S-Tab>  Select the previous link, then the previous pane                                                               │ │
│ │  Editing                                                                                                                   │ │
│ │    i , <F2>  Edit at the description                                                                                       │ │
│ │    a , A  Edit at the end of the line                                                                                      │ │
│ │    I  Edit at the priority                                                                                                 │ │
│ │    cc , S  Replace the description                                                                                         │ │
│ │    o  Add an item below                                                                                                    │ │
│ │    O  Add an item above                                                                                                    │ │
│ │    go  Add an item below that waits for this one                                                                           │ │
│ │    gO  Add an item above that this one waits for                                                                           │ │
│ │  Items                                                                                                                     │ │
│ │    t  Cycle todo, doing and done                                                                                           │ │
│ │    T  Stop doing an item                                                                                                   │ │
│ │    x , <Space>  Complete or reopen an item                                                                                 │ │
│ │    dd , <Del>  Delete an item                                                                                              │ │
│ │    yy  Copy an item                                                                                                        │ │
│ │    p  Paste below the cursor                                                                                               │ │
│ │    P  Paste above the cursor                                                                                               │ │
│ │    J , <A-Down>  Move the item down                                                                                        │ │
│ │    K , <A-Up>  Move the item up                                                                                            │ │
│ │    gp , -  Raise or lower the priority                                                                                     │ │
│ │    gP , +  Cycle the priority back                                                                                         │ │
│ │    gd  Set the due date                                                                                                    │ │
│ │    gt  Add a tag                                                                                                           │ │
│ │    gT  Remove a tag                                                                                                        │ │
